{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46848","headline":"题梁贤巽公房 · 齐己","name":"题梁贤巽公房","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吴王庙侧有高房，帘影南轩日正长。\n吹苑野风桃叶碧，压畦春露菜花黄。\n悬灯向後惟冥默，凭案前头即渺茫。\n知有虎溪归梦切，寺门松折社僧亡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46848.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46848","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}